@baseUrl = http://localhost:8888
@accessToken = 로그인_응답의_accessToken

### 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "quest17",
  "password": "1234",
  "nickname": "퀘스트17"
}

### 로그인
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "quest17",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 내 정보
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 게시글 목록 (공개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts?page=1&size=20

### 게시글 상세 (공개)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1

### 게시글 작성 — URL 끝에 숫자 없음!
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "글 제목",
  "content": "글 내용"
}

### 댓글 작성
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "bno": 1,
  "content": "댓글 내용"
}

### 잘못된 예 — 403 발생
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "이 URL은 등록 API가 아님",
  "content": "상세 조회는 GET /api/posts/1"
}
